{"meta":{"id":"ng-ts-utility-types","title":"Utility types (Partial, Pick, Omit, Record, Readonly...) và mapped type — bạn dùng vào việc gì?","track":"angular","topic":"typescript","tags":["typescript","utility-types","mapped-types"],"type":"question","level":"mid","domain":[],"asked_at":[],"minutes":6,"status":"done","verified_on":"2026-11-09","ng_version":"22","private":false,"related":["ng-ts-generics","ng-ts-conditional-types","ng-fm-typed-forms"],"srs":true,"sources":[],"layer":"theory","askedAt":[],"verifiedOn":"2026-11-09","ngVersion":"22"},"intro":"","sections":[{"key":"question","label":"Câu hỏi","role":"prompt","answer":false,"empty":false,"html":"<p>Bạn dùng utility types của TypeScript vào việc gì? Mapped type là gì? Tự viết lại <code>Partial</code> thế nào?</p>\n"},{"key":"quick","label":"Câu trả lời tốt nhất","role":"primary","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<p>Utility type giúp <strong>tạo kiểu mới từ kiểu có sẵn</strong> thay vì khai báo lại và để chúng lệch nhau. Tôi dùng hằng ngày: <code>Partial&lt;T&gt;</code> cho payload PATCH, <code>Pick</code>/<code>Omit</code> cho DTO tạo mới bỏ <code>id</code>, <code>createdAt</code>, <code>Record&lt;K, V&gt;</code> cho bảng tra như nhãn theo trạng thái, <code>Readonly</code>/<code>ReadonlyArray</code> cho state không được sửa tại chỗ, <code>ReturnType</code>/<code>Awaited</code> để lấy kiểu từ hàm có sẵn, <code>NonNullable</code> sau khi lọc null. Bên dưới, phần lớn chúng là <strong>mapped type</strong>: duyệt qua từng key bằng <code>[K in keyof T]</code> và biến đổi kiểu của nó. <code>Partial&lt;T&gt;</code> tự viết chỉ là <code>{ [K in keyof T]?: T[K] }</code>.</p>\n"},{"key":"deep","label":"Trả lời đầy đủ","role":"detail","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<h3>Hay dùng nhất</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Utility</th>\n<th>Việc</th>\n<th>Ví dụ thật</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Partial&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>mọi thuộc tính tuỳ chọn</td>\n<td><code>PATCH /contracts/:id</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Required&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>mọi thuộc tính bắt buộc</td>\n<td>cấu hình sau khi gộp mặc định</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Pick&lt;T, K&gt;</code> / <code>Omit&lt;T, K&gt;</code></td>\n<td>lấy / bỏ thuộc tính</td>\n<td><code>Omit&lt;Contract, 'id' | 'createdAt'&gt;</code> cho form tạo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Record&lt;K, V&gt;</code></td>\n<td>object với tập key cố định</td>\n<td><code>Record&lt;TxnStatus, string&gt;</code> nhãn hiển thị</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Readonly&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>không gán lại</td>\n<td>state trong store</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ReturnType&lt;F&gt;</code>, <code>Parameters&lt;F&gt;</code></td>\n<td>lấy từ hàm</td>\n<td>kiểu kết quả của hàm factory</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Awaited&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>bóc Promise</td>\n<td>kiểu kết quả <code>async</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>NonNullable&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>bỏ null/undefined</td>\n<td>sau <code>filter</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Extract</code> / <code>Exclude</code></td>\n<td>lọc union</td>\n<td><code>Exclude&lt;TxnStatus, 'PENDING'&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3><code>Record</code> bắt đủ trường hợp</h3>\n<div class=\"ih-code\" data-lang=\"ts\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TxnStatus</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PENDING'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'SUCCESS'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FAILED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LABEL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TxnStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  PENDING: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Đang xử lý'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  SUCCESS: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Thành công'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  FAILED: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Thất bại'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// thêm trạng thái mới mà quên nhãn -> lỗi compile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div><h3>Mapped type</h3>\n<div class=\"ih-code\" data-lang=\"ts\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MyPartial</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { [</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">K</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> keyof</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">K</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Mutable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-readonly</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">K</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> keyof</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">K</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// đổi tên key bằng `as` + template literal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Getters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { [</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">K</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> keyof</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `get${</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Capitalize</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> K</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">K</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Getters&#x3C;{ name: string }> = { getName: () => string }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// cờ lỗi cho từng field form</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FieldErrors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { [</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">K</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> keyof</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div><h3>Kiểu dẫn xuất thay vì khai báo lặp</h3>\n<div class=\"ih-code\" data-lang=\"ts\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Contract</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">holder</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">premium</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">createdAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CreateContractDto</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Omit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Contract</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'id'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'createdAt'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UpdateContractDto</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Partial</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">CreateContractDto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div><p>Thêm field vào <code>Contract</code> thì DTO tự cập nhật — không còn ba định nghĩa lệch nhau.</p>\n<h3><code>satisfies</code> đi cùng</h3>\n<div class=\"ih-code\" data-lang=\"ts\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ROUTES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  home: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  accounts: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/accounts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">satisfies</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`/${</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// kiểm tra đúng dạng nhưng giữ kiểu literal của từng key để autocomplete</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div>"},{"key":"real","label":"Thực tế trong dự án của tôi","role":"personal","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Ngữ cảnh</strong> dựng từ dự án thật trong CV của bạn — kiểm tra lại chi tiết trước khi dùng. <strong>Tình huống điển hình</strong> là tình huống hay gặp ở dự án Angular ngân hàng, bảo hiểm do app biên soạn để luyện cách kể; số liệu trong đó là ví dụ minh hoạ. Khi phỏng vấn, chỉ nhận là của mình phần bạn đã thật sự làm; phần còn lại kể là tình huống đã tìm hiểu hoặc tái hiện.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>Ngữ cảnh:</strong> ngân hàng A — form sửa hồ sơ chỉ gửi trường thay đổi, form tạo không có <code>id</code>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Đã làm:</strong> <code>Partial&lt;T&gt;</code> cho payload cập nhật, <code>Omit&lt;T, 'id'&gt;</code> cho payload tạo, <code>Pick</code> cho dữ liệu dòng của bảng, <code>Record&lt;TrangThai, string&gt;</code> cho nhãn hiển thị theo trạng thái.</li>\n<li><strong>Kết quả:</strong> đổi DTO gốc thì các kiểu dẫn xuất tự cập nhật.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Tình huống điển hình:</strong> Form tạo và form sửa hồ sơ dùng chung một kiểu; form tạo phải gửi <code>id</code> rỗng và backend báo lỗi. Đội dùng <code>Omit&lt;CaseDto, 'id' | 'createdAt'&gt;</code> cho payload tạo, <code>Partial&lt;...&gt;</code> cho payload cập nhật chỉ gửi trường đổi, <code>Pick</code> cho dữ liệu dòng bảng, <code>Record&lt;CaseStatus, string&gt;</code> cho nhãn trạng thái để thiếu nhãn là lỗi biên dịch, <code>Readonly</code> cho state từ store. Hết lỗi gửi trường thừa.</p>\n<p><strong>Lưu ý khi kể:</strong> Ví dụ trong repo chỉ nêu khi đúng.</p>\n"},{"key":"followup","label":"Sẽ bị hỏi tiếp","role":"next","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<ul>\n<li><strong><code>Omit</code> có kiểm tra key tồn tại không?</strong> Không — <code>Omit&lt;T, 'idd'&gt;</code> không báo lỗi gõ sai. Có thể tự viết <code>StrictOmit&lt;T, K extends keyof T&gt;</code> để chặn.</li>\n<li><strong><code>Readonly&lt;T&gt;</code> có sâu không?</strong> Không, chỉ tầng ngoài; cần sâu thì viết <code>DeepReadonly</code> đệ quy bằng mapped + conditional type, hoặc chấp nhận kỷ luật bất biến.</li>\n<li><strong><code>Partial</code> cho form update có rủi ro gì?</strong> Mọi field đều tuỳ chọn kể cả những field bắt buộc khi cập nhật; nếu backend cần một số field luôn có thì dùng <code>Partial&lt;X&gt; &amp; Pick&lt;X, 'version'&gt;</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n"},{"key":"traps","label":"Bẫy thường gặp","role":"caution","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<ul>\n<li><strong>Khai báo lại DTO bằng tay</strong> — lệch với model khi thêm field.</li>\n<li><strong>Nghĩ <code>Readonly</code> chặn sửa object con</strong> — chỉ tầng ngoài.</li>\n<li><strong>Dùng <code>Record&lt;string, X&gt;</code> cho tập key cố định</strong> — mất kiểm tra đủ key; dùng union key.</li>\n</ul>\n"},{"key":"sources","label":"Nguồn","role":"reference","answer":false,"empty":false,"html":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/utility-types.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TypeScript — Utility types</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/2/mapped-types.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TypeScript — Mapped types</a></li>\n</ul>\n"}]}